          "title": "Bohol, Philippines",
          "description": "The Chocolate Hills of Bohol. Go there in the early morning hours and you will see the scenery in the awesome morning mist. Priceless.\nwww.eardex.com/cost-of-living/calculator.php?city_name=Ta...\n\nCost of living: www.eardex.com\nCredit: Eardex.com (CC BY 2.0)",
