          "id": "9274505687",
          "title": "Glass mounted butterflies",
          "description": "After the humour filled explanations, you are free to look around the other glass mounted displays. This panel with 9 very dead butterflies is very nicely placed against an open window where can see the beautiful forest like landscaping of the facility. The mist effect is due to mesh behind the glass pane. (Bohol- Tagbilaran, Philippines, May 2013)",
